		As for any vertex $u \in X_1$ and $t\neq 1$, $w_{X_1}(u) \leq w_{X_t}(u)$ we note that the following holds.
		\begin{eqnarray*}
			w(X_1', V(G)\setminus X_1) &\geq& (k-1) \sum_{u \in X_1'} w_{X_1} (u) \\
			&\geq& (k-1) (2w(G[X_1']) + w(\{x\}, X_1')) \\
			&\geq& 2(k-1) w(G[X_1']) + (k-1)r.
