The dashed circles in the intrinsic section of the right panel represent the outer Mohr's circles at the onset of crack nucleation for the three state states $A$, $B$, and $C$ in the left panel, that are examples of the critical states for the three class of loading directions described in Section~\ref{sec:examples-tresca-cap}.
