  Suppose that $X \in \mcalM$.
  We can take $\langle F_n \mid n<\omega\rangle \in \NWD^\omega$ such that 
  $\bigcup_{n<\omega} F_n = X$.
  Then $\tilde{\varphi}(\langle F_n \mid n<\omega\rangle) \in \omega^\omega$ witnesses that $\varphi$ is a Tukey map.
\end{proof}

