We thank Yusuke Hayashi for valuable discussions on the definition and properties of the pre-Tukey relation.
We also thank Toshimichi Usuba for comments on the Tukey reducibility in the context without choice.
We appreciate Jonathan Schilhan's meaningful remarks on forcing absoluteness in Section 4.5.

