\subsection{Query Execution Time}

\begin{figure*}[th]
    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{query_execution_times}
    \caption{Total end-to-end query execution times, which includes  the added cardinality estimation times.
    SPN sketch approximations are denoted by \textdagger.
