Finally, 
$$
p_{\mathrm{s}}(2, h, v) \geq p_{\mathrm{s}}(0) + \frac{1}{16}\biggl(1 - (1 - p_{\mathrm{w}}(0))^2\biggr)^2 > 0.5+\frac{1}{16}(1-0.075^2)^2 > 0.5617.
$$
The second bound in~\eqref{eq:four_inequalities_strong} follows. \\


