   $\text{Inv}(\Sigma_A \cup E_A,\sigma)=\{\lambda\mu+(1-\lambda)\widetilde{\mu} : \lambda \in [0,1], \mu \in \text{Inv}(\Sigma_A,\sigma)\}$.
