\paragraph{\bf Planned Features and Extensions}
Two specific extensions can be considered as natural next steps for the project. 
%\hh{modified -- check:}
Firstly, we plan to include linear-based and grammar-based GP in the context of our tiny module approach, enabling a scope on the representation level that can be used for a first broad comparative study performed with TinyverseGP. 
Secondly, on the domain level, we will concentrate on the integration of program synthesis benchmarks by providing an interface for the General Program Synthesis Benchmark Suites (PSB1 and PSB2) proposed by Helmuth \emph{et al.}~\cite{DBLP:conf/gecco/HelmuthS15, DBLP:conf/gecco/HelmuthK21}; 
