\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusions}

We have proposed the first prototype of a modular cross-domain benchmarking framework for GP that is meant to be the blueprint for a large and scalable framework.
TinyverseGP can already be used to evaluate various benchmarks from three problem domains to which GP is highly applicable, including the underrepresented domain of policy search. % \hh{be more specific}
to achieve a better balance against overused benchmarks.

